iquilistlán Cocula Cuautitlán de García Barragán Cuautla Ejutla El Grullo El Limón Gómez Farias Guachinango Juchitlán Mixtlán San Gabriel San Marcos San Martín Hidalgo Sayula Tapalpa Techaluta de Montenegro Tecolotlán Tenamaxtlán Teocuitatlán de Corona Tolimán Tonaya Tuxcacuesco Tuxcueca Unión de Tula Villa Corona Villa Purificación Zacoalco de Torres Zapotitlán de Vadill Zapotlán el Grande FCDO advises against all but essential travel to the northern municipalities of: Bolaños Chimaltitán Colotlán Hostotipaquillo Huejúcar Huequilla el Alto Mezquitic San Martin de Bolaños Santa Maria de los Ángeles Totatiche Villa Guerrero This is due to inaccessibility for security forces, lack of state control, drugs cultivation and high levels of violence between rival criminal groups."},{"form":"against all but essential travel","text":"advises against all but essential travel to the whole state of Colima, except the city of Manzanillo accessed by sea or by air via Manzanillo-Costalegre International Airport, and direct travel via road 200 from the airport to Manzanillo."}],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-19","page_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}},"timing":{"peak":"Dec-Apr (dry, lowest sargassum, highest price/crowds)","shoulder":"late Apr-Jun & Nov (~30-40% off, good weather)","green":"Jul-Oct (hurricane/rain, 40-60% below peak Sep-Oct)","booking_lead":"~3-4 months for Dec-Apr peak & spring break; 2-3 months off-peak","off_season_specials":"~30-40% off May-Jun & Nov shoulder; 40-60% off Sep-Oct green trough","event_peaks":["Spring Break (Mar)","whale-shark run mid-May-mid-Sept peak Jun-Aug","winter holidays late Dec"],"campaign_start":"market Dec-Apr peak by ~September; push whale-shark green-season from ~March"},"jewels":[{"name":"MUSA Underwater Museum","si_tag":"diveglobal","status":"future","hook":"470+ submerged sculptures, divable by OW divers and snorkelers","bookable_category":"dive/snorkel/glass-bottom tour","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.bluewaterdivetravel.com/scuba-musa-isla-mujeres-cancun","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"470+ submerged sculptures, divable by OW divers and snorkelers","when":"year-round","commission":"local dive-op/DMC → Viator/GYG affiliate"},{"name":"Whale-shark aggregation run","si_tag":"ocean","status":"future","hook":"snorkel the world''s largest whale-shark gathering, Jun-Aug peak","bookable_category":"boat snorkel excursion","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.islandlifemexico.com/cancun-snorkeling-diving-guide/","si":"ocean","blurb":"snorkel the world''s largest whale-shark gathering, Jun-Aug peak","commission":"DMC/operator → OTA affiliate"},{"name":"Route of the Cenotes","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"live","hook":"jungle-road cenote circuit for swim/dive/zipline","bookable_category":"day tour + entry","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.islandlifemexico.com/cancun-snorkeling-diving-guide/","timing":"Dec-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","blurb":"jungle-road cenote circuit for swim/dive/zipline","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"DMC → OTA (entry = pass-through)"},{"name":"Turtle-nesting programs (May-Sept)","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"live","hook":"green/hawksbill/loggerhead nesting + resort release programs","bookable_category":"eco/resort activity","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.islandlifemexico.com/cancun-snorkeling-diving-guide/","si":"adventure","blurb":"green/hawksbill/loggerhead nesting + resort release programs","commission":"resort/DMC (often pass-through)"},{"name":"South Hotel Zone / Playa Mujeres (sargassum-protected)","si_tag":"tropical","status":"live","hook":"cleaner beach stretches in a heavy sargassum year","bookable_category":"hotel + transfer","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.howisthesargassum.com/blog/sargassum-june-2026-update","timing":"Dec-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"tropical","blurb":"cleaner beach stretches in a heavy sargassum year","when":"Dec-Apr","commission":"all-inclusive portal → Amstar transfer → OTA"}],"faq":[{"q":"What health risks should I actually plan for in Cancún?","a":"Water, mosquitoes, hurricanes and sargassum — not violent crime. Drink bottled/purified water; use repellent for dengue (no malaria in Quintana Roo tourist zones); hurricane season runs June–November with September riskiest; and sargassum peaks around July in 2026.","source":"travel.state.gov","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Will sargassum ruin the beaches in 2026?","a":"It''s a real risk in 2026 — plan location, don''t cancel. 2026 is tracking as one of the worst sargassum years on record, often peaking around July in the Riviera Maya; north Cancún and Playa Mujeres are among the more protected stretches, and Jan–March runs lowest on sargassum.","source":"howisthesargassum.com","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"When and how can I swim with whale sharks?","a":"Mid-May to mid-September, peaking June–August, on a snorkel-only boat excursion off Isla Mujeres/Holbox — the world''s largest whale-shark aggregation. It''s a green-season spike inside the low-price window, so rooms are cheaper then; life-vest, no-touch, follow-the-guide.","source":"islandlifemexico.com","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"Can beginners dive MUSA and the reef?","a":"Yes — MUSA is one of the most accessible dives anywhere. The 470+ statues sit 3.5–8 m down, shallow enough for Open Water divers, snorkelers and glass-bottom boats; no-fly-after-diving is 18–24 hours and these are shallow (≤9 m) day dives.","source":"bluewaterdivetravel.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Is Cancún good for an all-inclusive honeymoon, and where''s the top end?","a":"Yes — it''s a honeymoon engine. The Hotel Zone is dense all-inclusive inventory; the one true ultra address in Cancún proper is NIZUC (Punta Nizuc, ~15 min from the airport), with the deepest luxury bench just down-corridor in Mayakoba/Maroma (Rosewood, Banyan Tree, Maroma/Belmond).","source":"virtuoso.com","si_tag":"tropical"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Cancún, Mexico: Reef, MUSA & Whale-Shark Gateway","meta_description":"Cancún sits on the world''s second-longest reef — dive MUSA, snorkel the whale-shark run, base for cenotes and Maya ruins. Best time, safety, and how to book.","slug":"cancun-mexico","primary_keyword":"Cancún diving and snorkeling","long_tail":["Cancún MUSA underwater museum","Cancún whale shark tour season","best time to visit Cancún","Cancún all-inclusive honeymoon","Cancún cenote day trip"],"search_language":"EN primary + ES-MX; page answers real ES queries restated (not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["mejor época para viajar a Cancún","buceo MUSA Cancún","tour tiburón ballena Cancún","qué hacer en Cancún cenotes","Cancún todo incluido luna de miel","temporada de sargazo Cancún","villas de lujo Riviera Maya"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX","x-default:en"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-07-04"},"booking":{"bin":"freely_bookable","level":"L2","codes":[],"consent_flow":false,"note":"Quintana Roo/Mexico US L2 (Exercise Increased Caution) - freely bookable; MXN currency, USD widely accepted"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-31","hits":9,"misses":13,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"tropical","name":"tropical","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"live"},{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"future"},{"si":"ocean","name":"ocean","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"NIZUC Resort & Spa","why_ultra":"only true in-Cancún ultra enclave (Punta Nizuc), 274 suites/villas facing the reef","earning":"agent/consortium on application via host + Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"Virtuoso member — free upgrades + amenities","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack / Virtuoso)"},{"name":"Rosewood Mayakoba","why_ultra":"boutique ~130 lagoon/beach suites, private pools + butler, on mangrove canals","earning":"agent/consortium on application via host + Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"Virtuoso member","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack)"},{"name":"Banyan Tree Mayakoba","why_ultra":"all-villa private-pool privacy inside Mayakoba","earning":"agent/consortium on application via host + Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"Virtuoso member","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack)"},{"name":"Fairmont Mayakoba","why_ultra":"full-amenity luxury tier of the Mayakoba four","earning":"agent/consortium on application via host","virtuoso_value_add":"verify (reported NOT Virtuoso; check Accor ALL/other)","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack)"},{"name":"Chablé Maroma","why_ultra":"wellness-forward design ultra, private beach, Jorge Vallejo dining","earning":"agent/consortium on application via host + Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"verify present","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack)"},{"name":"Maroma, A Belmond Hotel","why_ultra":"legendary private-beach ultra, Belmond/LVMH tier","earning":"agent/consortium on application via host + Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"Belmond typically Virtuoso — verify","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack)"},{"name":"La Casa de la Playa (by Xcaret)","why_ultra":"Xcaret''s top-tier ultra all-inclusive, adults/couples + eco-park access","earning":"agent/consortium via Xcaret trade / host on application","virtuoso_value_add":"verify","mor":"safe (commissionable-rack)"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"Cancún, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":21.1619,"lng":-86.8515}}'::jsonb, 19),
